# Products Page Design System (Canonical Reference)

Storefront catalog page. Match `front_end/src/pages/Products.js` + `front_end/src/styles/pages/Products.css`. Shared tokens: `App.css`, header pattern: `PageDesign.css` + `PageHeader.js`. Storefront baseline: `.cursor/rules/home-design-system.mdc`.

## Canonical files

| Layer | Path |
|-------|------|
| Page | `front_end/src/pages/Products.js` |
| Styles | `front_end/src/styles/pages/Products.css` |
| Header | `front_end/src/components/PageHeader.js` |
| i18n | `tUi()` keys in `front_end/src/locales/{en,ar,fr}/common.json` |

## Page shell & naming

- Wrapper: `products-page page-shell`
- **Always use `products-*` prefix** — never bare `.card`, `.grid`, `.filters`
- Typography: Space Grotesk (UI), Fraunces (titles, card names)
- Tokens only (`--primary-color`, `--surface`, `--border-color`, `--shadow`) — no hardcoded colors when a token exists

## Layout (desktop)

Two-column grid inside `products-layout`:

```
products-page
  products-layout                    ← grid: sidebar | main
    aside.products-filters-sidebar   ← left, sticky
    div.products-main                ← catalog column, max 1400px
      PageHeader (Browse the catalog + promo)
      products-active-filters        ← chips when filtered
      products-discounts-section     ← optional, max 4 cards
      products-catalog-section       ← toolbar + grid + pagination
```

CSS variables:
- `--products-sidebar-width: 280px`
- `--products-content-width: 1400px` (match other storefront pages)

Grid: `minmax(240px, 280px) minmax(0, 1400px)`, gap `1.25rem`.  
Layout width: `min(sidebar + content + gap, 100%)`, centered with `margin-inline: auto`.

**Do not use `transform` on `.products-layout`** — it breaks `position: sticky` on the filters sidebar.

## Filters sidebar (left)

- Sticky: `top: calc(var(--navbar-height) + 1rem)`, `align-self: start`
- `max-height: calc(100vh - var(--navbar-height) - 1.5rem)`; scroll body with `.products-filters-sidebar-body { overflow-y: auto }`
- Card: `var(--surface)`, `border-radius: 1.2rem`, `1px solid var(--border-color)`, head gradient tint
- **Header:** single `h2.products-filters-title` only — no duplicate kicker + title
- Controls: pill inputs/selects (`height: 42px`, `border-radius: 999px`)
- Foot: full-width `.products-apply-btn` + `.products-clear-btn`

## Catalog column (`products-main`)

- `PageHeader` lives **inside** `products-main` (right of filters), not full-width above layout
- Promo in header actions: `.products-promo-band` — gradient like Home `.promo-band`, `border-radius: 1.5rem`, `min-width: 0` for wrap
- Section kickers: `.products-discounts-kicker` (red), `.products-catalog-kicker` (primary)
- Toolbar: `.products-toolbar` with product count
- Active filters: `.products-active-filters` + `.products-filter-chip`

## Product grids & cards

- **Grid:** `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(100%, 180px), 1fr))`, `justify-content: start`, gap `1.15rem`
- Same grid sizing for `.products-discounts-grid` and `.products-grid`
- Cards: `.products-card`, `.products-discount-card` — `border-radius: 1–1.2rem`, hover lift `0.3s ease`
- Discount badge: red pill top-end; category pill: frosted overlay (light/dark per home rule)
- Image overlays: light `rgba(255,255,255,0.92)` / dark `rgba(15,23,42,0.82)` — never `--text-primary` on light pills in dark mode

## RTL (Arabic) — same structure as English

- **Shell:** `direction: ltr` on `.products-page` so filters stay **physically left**
- **Text:** `direction: rtl` on `.products-filters-sidebar` and `.products-main`
- **Header row:** `direction: ltr` on `.page-header-top`; `direction: rtl` + `text-align: start` on copy/actions/promo so title stays left / promo right like English
- Center page with viewport breakout on `.products-page`: `width: 100vw; margin-inline: calc(50% - 50vw); padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 2rem)` — avoids RTL shift right
- Mirror card overlays with `inset-inline-*`; rating `transform-origin` for RTL

## Responsive breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Behavior |
|------------|----------|
| **≤1100px** | PageHeader stacks column; promo full width |
| **≤1024px** | Single column: filters stack above catalog; sidebar `position: static`; reset page breakout padding |
| **≤768px** | Page gap `2rem`; grids `repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr))` |
| **≤480px** | Tighter grid gap; smaller card title/price type |

## i18n

- All visible strings via `tUi('ui.pages.products.{key}')` — add **en, ar, fr** together
- Keys: `catalogTitle_*`, `catalogSubtitle_*`, `filters_*`, `clearFilters_*`, `applyFilters_*`, etc.

## When extending

1. Copy patterns from existing `Products.js` / `Products.css` — do not invent generic class names
2. Keep filters left + catalog at 1400px unless explicitly asked to change layout
3. Preserve sticky sidebar and RTL parity when editing layout CSS
4. No stats row unless requested; product cards stay compact grid (`180px` min column)
